## Upstream notices (retained, not superseded)

This repository incorporates work from upstream MIT-licensed projects. Their
copyright notices are retained in the files below and continue to apply to the
paths listed. The notice above does not replace them.

| Scope | Upstream notice |
|---|---|
| `interactive/` (the whole subtree) | `interactive/LICENSE` — derived from `babamba2/superclaude-for-sap` |

This scope was briefly narrowed to 36 files on 2026-08-22 (D-103) and **restored
on 2026-08-23 (D-104)**: the narrowing counted only files classified `copy` and
missed the `transform` class entirely. A second review then found that even the
replacement count was short, because the ledger's own path mapping had missed a
dozen procedure files. A reverse scan — starting from the files in this tree
rather than from the ledger — puts the figure at **56 files** that still share
long lines with the upstream original: 25 personas, 16 procedures, and 15 others
(D-106). `interactive/LICENSE` lists them by group.
`interactive/LICENSE` records what is known file-by-file. The notice covers the
subtree until that accounting is finished; see `docs/BLUEPRINT.md` §1.3.

Component-level attribution for the distributed plugin, including bundled
runtime dependencies, is in `interactive/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
